invariant: INV-66
file: Makefile
catches: test/widemul-builds.sh
reason: make writes CH_P256_ADX_MODEL for every host object, so
  p256_adx_field.c would read test/p256_adx_model.h, portable C in place of
  its two assembly routines, and a session with CH_CPU_BMI2_ADX would run
  test code that no library build may hold. test/widemul-builds.sh refuses
  a host object's defines that name it.

--- old
             $(CPU_RUNTIME_DEF))
--- new
             $(CPU_RUNTIME_DEF) $(if $(CPU_RUNTIME_DEF),-DCH_P256_ADX_MODEL))
